{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"[operator-attested] LIVE BEDROCK EVIDENCE — the canary was RUN, not merely written.\n\nCommand: REBAR_RUN_EXTERNAL=1 REBAR_LIVE_BEDROCK=1 AWS_PROFILE=frontier AWS_REGION=us-east-2 pytest tests/external/test_bedrock_cache_live.py -m external\nResult: 1 passed in 3.86s, against real AWS Bedrock (account 5797...98, us-east-2).\n\nWhat that actually proves, since a canary that passes without calling AWS would be worthless: the test drives the REAL PydanticAIRunner through two identical-prefix single_turn calls and asserts usage[cache_read_tokens] > 0 on the SECOND. It is not vacuous — with caching ineffective the assertion fails with the observed usage dict. It exercised bedrock:{DEFAULT_BEDROCK_MODEL_ID}, i.e. rebar's documented default, so the default is verified rather than assumed.\n\nThis discharges the AC 'the live cache canary reports cache_read_tokens ... and this ticket carries a comment stating which caches and which rebar documents as the default'. The underlying measurement (recorded earlier on this ticket) was: us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6 cache_write=4017 then cache_read=4017, reproducible; on-demand ids not invokable at all; us. AND global. opus-4-5 silently do not cache while billing full input.\n\nCI SAFETY VERIFIED: the canary is correctly confined. Default selection (-m 'not integration and not external') deselected count went 114 -> 115 with its addition and collected count is unchanged, so CI never makes a billable AWS call. It lives under tests/external/ as conftest.py structurally requires — an earlier draft of the plan said tests/live/, which would have either run billable calls on every CI run or hard-failed collection for the whole suite.\n\nFULL GATING SUITE: 7538 passed, 29 skipped, 115 deselected, exit 0, 28m28s (baseline 7524 + the 14 new unit tests)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785413437659999001,"uuid":"36214493-51f0-412b-9e21-29df21332d02"}